    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Consistent Hashing Ring for even data distribution</para>
<para>Uses virtual nodes to ensure balanced distribution even with uneven number of shards. Each shard gets multiple positions on the hash ring (virtual nodes) to improve balance.</para>
<para>Benefits:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Minimal data movement on shard add/remove (only 1/N of data moves)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Even distribution with virtual nodes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fast lookup O(log N) where N is number of virtual nodes </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
